{"server":"tw","storyId":"act14side_level_act14side_05_beg","groupId":"act14side","stageId":"act14side_05","title":"獵場","storyCode":"BI-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5b1a8243d5b094b9ef2f54d306d3a1f07155172a19f932fd86ad6fbab0dbe226","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士透過雅兒瞭解了部分謝拉格的歷史。\n聖獵中，恩雅正與阿克托斯交談，突然一群野獸襲來，恩雅不僅不懼，反而出手折服眾人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！我在，聖女大人有何吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必如此緊張，阿克托斯大人，我並非食人猛獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，這是您第一次親自參與聖獵。不光是我，您看看這些戰士們，在聖女大人您面前大家都繃緊了，想好好表現一番！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......作為聖女，與耶拉岡德的戰士們一同參與聖獵，我認為這是我應當做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這話說得有理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說我了。我見您從狩獵開始時，就一直像是有什麼心事，若是有什麼想問的，就請直接問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，瞞不過聖女大人，您見笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您不介意，可以將我當成一個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我也會將您當成一個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心中，也把聖女大人您當作一個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，就讓我們像朋友似的說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，那麼恕我直言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，聖女大人，究竟是怎麼看待還政一事的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您很爽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友之間，自當如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我佩爾羅契家的人論戰鬥，不會輸給布朗陶和希瓦艾什，但論陰謀詭計，實在不是這兩家的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彎彎繞繞，遮遮掩掩絕非我的風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得不錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我的朋友，還是得請您原諒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在回答您的問題之前，我需要先向您確認一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯大人，您是一位忠勇、虔誠的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚您率直、爽快，同時我也知曉，您絕不是真的毫無考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您說朋友之間理應不遮不掩，那麼我亦當效仿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我想知道，一直以來，為什麼您會如此堅定地反對恩希歐迪斯的開放政策？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是個粗人，聖女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論恩希歐迪斯將他的所謂開放吹得有多好，有多吸引人，我要的不是那些誇誇其談，不是那些漂亮話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只看他帶來了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我看到的是湧進我們家中的毫無信仰的外國人，是打著發展旗號對土地山川的破壞，是在他的領地裡工作後日漸失去信仰的謝拉格人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他帶進來的那些東西是好用，他因此賺了很多錢，造了很多大房子，我當然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是如果人人都學他那樣，為了所謂的發展，就把信仰拋在腦後，那麼這片土地會變成什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德既然令我佩爾羅契家守衛謝拉格，那我阿克托斯就決不能容忍有任何人，以任何方式想要將其破壞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿克托斯大人的想法我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼該我回答您的問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯大人提出要將核心領地盡數交於我手，此事事出突然，確實在我的意料之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人果然也不知情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，在此之前，我對他竟有這種打算一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論恩希歐迪斯大人究竟是出於何種考量，才提出還政一事，就結果而言，我並不認為這是一個很壞的發展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我坐在蔓珠院中，日日夜夜看著人們向耶拉岡德祈禱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一點我比恩希歐迪斯大人要清楚，那就是——謝拉格還無法失去信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既做出了這樣的決定，接下來的許多事情，我想，就不再是誰個人說了便能算數的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外總會發生，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若恩希歐迪斯大人沒有提前料想到這一點，那就是他的不是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行，其他的我不管，但我信您這句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞，您剛剛說話時，直到聽到您最後的話之前，我都覺得自己好像不是在與聖女大人對話，而是在面對另一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這是我多心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果會讓阿克托斯大人產生這樣的感覺，我必須說，這讓我感到難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我絕不會否認，我也姓希瓦艾什。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，成為聖女後我的一切便與俗世割離。令這個姓氏於我而言不再有意義的，卻也正是恩希歐迪斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"野獸們終於按捺不住了嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人準備狩獵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g6_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人畫像，聖女大人刺繡，聖女大人雕像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格人的信仰象徵，還猶豫什麼，現在就將耶拉岡德的祝福請回家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"人真多......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Sharp那邊不知道順不順利。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（發出難以名狀的叫聲）","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，反而嚇了我一跳......"}]},{"label":"你的手好冰！","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回過神來啦？"}]},{"label":"（下意識地反擊）","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，你的手好冰啊......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發什麼呆呢，我一眼就看到你站在這兒一動不動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，該不會真的嚇到你了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"嚇死我了！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你這不是根本沒事嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛你在看什麼？之前的聖獵儀式你看到了沒？這次就連聖女大人也要一起參加狩獵，大家都很期待呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大典的由來是怎樣的？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據說是因為蔓珠院幾百年前從古籍中發現耶拉岡德初現的日子是這天，於是就把這天定為了謝拉格最大的節日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於大典要做什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所見，對普通人來說，就是享受節日的歡愉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對聖女大人來說，則還有一項工作要做——為聖獵獲得的山雪鬼戰利品驅魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體是怎麼樣的過程，你等一下就能看到了。"}]},{"label":"你看起來興致不是很高。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，有沒有人說過你真的很敏銳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然每到這種時候，我就可以拋下院裡的事務，出來享受節日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過一想到聖女大人還有那麼多事要做，而那些事我又都幫不上忙，心裡還是有些不是滋味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，算了，大過節的，不說這些了。"}]},{"label":"有什麼推薦的娛樂項目嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這你可就問對人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娛樂項目......可能沒有多少，畢竟除了集市之外，大多還是和耶拉岡德有關的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果你想借此瞭解耶拉岡德的話，這可是個好機會。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我帶你到處逛逛~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每年到這個時候，於大學院任教和學習的修士們會來到蔓珠院中，在這裡為人們講經，或者講述有關耶拉岡德的歷史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"千年前，祖先們觸怒了耶拉岡德，耶拉岡德不再保護謝拉格，嚴冬就此降臨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"為了平息耶拉岡德的怒火，蔓珠院每年都會挑選靈魂最為純潔的少女，踏上天路，將代表祂的鈴鐺掛上山巔，並將自己的靈魂獻給祂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"在第一百位少女的呼喚下，耶拉岡德終於寬恕了謝拉格的人民，嚴冬終於終結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"而謝拉格的第一任聖女也正是由此誕生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這一段歷史啊......對了，我在蔓珠院的典籍中，還看過另一個版本的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"另一個版本？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"聽起來更有現實感。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧，同時也很殘忍。"}]},{"label":"聽起來像是你親眼所見。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有。我在經卷閣裡偶然發現的，可能是當時的親歷者留下的記錄，也有可能只是單純的妄言。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，謝拉格的雪山，是會吃人的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺！前方突然出現大批野獸......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些野獸異常暴躁，正在攻擊我們最前方的戰士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"區區野獸，不足為懼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們留在這裡保護聖女大人，保持陣型不要慌亂。瓦萊絲，你也留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人跟我來，支援前方的兄弟們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯大人，請等一等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也與各位一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，聖女大人的安全......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦萊絲說得對，聖女大人的安全最重要，您放心在這裡等著便是，我佩爾羅契家的勇士們必定護聖女大人您周全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，阿克托斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......菈塔托絲？你怎麼會在這，你們另兩家的人不是該分頭往兩翼行動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希瓦艾什已經出發了。但我總覺得有什麼地方不對勁，本想分隊前過來提醒你要小心......現在看來倒是沒這個必要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這話什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托絲大人是想說，前方出現的獸群不同尋常？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人聰慧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然還不知道具體情況......但我總有不太好的預感。但願不要又是有什麼人，光作秀嫌不夠，還要在聖獵這樣莊嚴的場合作怪就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之小心點總沒錯。這次聖獵......連聖女大人都親自蒞臨，總歸是不同以往的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托絲大人言重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過您說的話也不無道理，我既已在此，便是要與各位勇士站在一處，沒有對危機避而不見的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，情況緊急，邊走邊說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人能如此想，是謝拉格之幸！再阻攔就是我的不是了，瓦萊絲，你帶路，我們走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼還不出現啊，莫希......！聖女參與聖獵這種千載難逢的好事都遇上了，在聖女面前解決野獸，多好的機會！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但萬一......萬一傷到聖女......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......啊呀不管了，菈塔托絲那女人總不會真把我怎麼樣！大不了我扛著就是了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一定要抓住機會啊，莫希！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些野獸怎麼不知道怕？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種情況絕不正常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為這次有聖女在隊伍裡，這些山裡的野獸也會多畏懼幾分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來也不儘然，聖女也沒那麼大的面子啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞎說什麼！聖女大人也是你能隨便談論的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話要是被阿克托斯大人聽到了，你自己好好想想後果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我知道了！哪敢被阿克托斯大人聽到，肯定要被罵死了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就好......等等，小心你背後——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"比冷冽的斥聲更快的是破開風雪的銀色弧光。\n野獸冒著寒光的尖牙近在咫尺，溫熱腥臭的獸血瞬間噴灑在戰士的臉上。\n謝拉格的聖女緩緩放下拉弓的手，於騷動之中邁動腳步，布朗陶與佩爾羅契追隨在其左右，正如所有典籍中所描述的那樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒受傷吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聖女、聖女大人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危機還沒有解除，請站起來，年輕的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德的勇士們，揮起你們的武器！和我一起擊退這些野獸，完成耶拉岡德給予我們的挑戰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為......聖女大人而戰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格戰士們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為聖女大人而戰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
